{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RadixHeap","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"RadixHeap","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap.swift#L17","fileName":"RadixHeap.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"PriorityQueueModule"}],"externalID":"s:19PriorityQueueModule9RadixHeapV","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RadixHeap"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A monotone min-priority queue of values with nonnegative integer keys, where no key inserted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is below the last key removed."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/count","doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/isEmpty","doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/lastRemovedKey"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/insert(_:key:)","doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/popMin()","doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/removeMin()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/PriorityQueueModule\/documentation\/PriorityQueueModule\/RadixHeap\/Element"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases","generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases"}],"relationshipsSecti